  m_Name: Amenemhat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exhibitName: 'Granite head of Amenemhat III '
  description: 'Colossal granodiorite head of Amenemhat III: his face is broader;
    the eyes, which would originally have been inlaid, are widely spaced and not
    heavily hooded. The lips are full. Diagonal muscles under the lower lip suggest
    tension in the heavy jaw. His expression is sombre, but it seems harsh, even
    brutal. '
